{"seq":2,"slug":"assessment","title":"评估体系","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/management/engineering-hiring-team-building/assessment","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"technical-interview-design","title":"技术面试设计方法论","url":"/l-doc-books/h/management/engineering-hiring-team-building/assessment/technical-interview-design","wordCount":1914,"readingTime":8},{"seq":2,"slug":"system-design-interview","title":"系统设计面试评估框架","url":"/l-doc-books/h/management/engineering-hiring-team-building/assessment/system-design-interview","wordCount":2003,"readingTime":9},{"seq":3,"slug":"behavioral-culture-fit","title":"行为与文化匹配面试","url":"/l-doc-books/h/management/engineering-hiring-team-building/assessment/behavioral-culture-fit","wordCount":1957,"readingTime":8}],"introHtml":"<h1 id=\"评估体系\">评估体系</h1><p>评估体系是招聘漏斗中信号密度最高的环节。一个优秀的评估系统需要在有限的时间窗口内，准确区分「能胜任」与「不能胜任」，同时让候选人感受到尊重与公平。</p>\n<p>本章覆盖技术面试的三大支柱：编码与技术深度面试的设计方法论、系统设计面试的评估框架、以及行为与文化匹配面试的结构化实施。三者互补——技术面试验证「能不能做」，系统设计面试验证「能不能想」，行为面试验证「能不能融」。</p>\n<p>这三篇共同构成一个完整的面试环路（interview loop），为最终的雇佣决策提供多维度、低偏差的信号。</p>\n"}